%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 48e62f8a00cf2e94c961d71b194803d5, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueContainer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueContainer
  Intro: 'It''s a bright sunny day in Los Angeles (just like it is every day in Los
    Angeles) and it''s time for the most LA event that can happen: a reality-style
    competition! $ makes % way through campus, and arrives in the green room as the
    other contestants start to arrive. Let''s meet them all!


'
  IntroducingYou: And then there's you!
  NewChallenge: 'It''s time for challenge #$!


'
  ChallengeIntroduction: 'This challenge is brought to you by $f, who teaches $d.


    $pd

    $pp


    $n
    announces the challenge:


    $a


    The challenge begins! Describe $y''s
    approach to the challenge. If the challenge involves writing or creating something,
    don''t feel like you have to create it all here, but give a summary of what $y
    tries to do.


'
  ChallengeOutcomesIntro: 'Let''s see how this challenge went for everyone...


'
  JudgeStarting: 'Now it''s time for $n to judge the competitors and decide a winner
    of the challenge...


'
  ChallengeResults: 'The results are in! Before announcing the winner, here''s $n''s
    feedback for each competitor:


    $f


    And finally, it''s time for $n to
    announce the winner:


    $a


    Congratulations to $w for winning the challenge!
    $w has immunity for this round. Everyone else is up for elimination.


'
  PlayerChooseWhoToTalkTo: '$n is free to start a conversation with one other player
    of $pp choice before the elimination happens, if you want to. Who does $n choose?


'
  OpeningLineRequest: 'What does $n say to $o?


'
  NpcInitiateConvoWithPlayer: '$o wants to talk to $n.


    $o: "$l"

'
  ConversationLine: '$n: "$l"

'
  EndOfConversation: '$n has ended the conversation.


'
  WaitForNpcToFinishTalking: 'Waiting for the other characters to finish their conversations...


'
  ChooseEliminationVote: 'It''s time for you to choose someone to vote for to be
    eliminated. Keep in mind that everyone will know who everyone else voted for
    when votes are revealed.


    Who do you choose?


'
  LoadingVotes: 'The other participants are finalizing their votes...


'
  VoteRevealIntro: 'It''s time to reveal the votes.


'
  IndividualVote: '$n has chosen to vote for $v to be eliminated.

'
  VotingConclusion: '

    $l has been eliminated from the competition.


'
  PlayerEliminated: Unfortunately, it looks like $n's story ends here. Better luck
    next time!
  PlayerWonFinalChallenge: 'Congratulations! $n won a spot in the final! And with
    it, the power to choose who else gets that honor.


    Who does $n choose to
    join $po in the final two?


'
  NpcChooseSecondFinalist: '$w is deliberating who to choose to advance to the final...


'
  FinalistChoiceAnnouncement: '$w has chosen $f to join $po in the finals!


'
  FinalsIntro: "It's time for the finals! Please welcome our two finalists: $f!\n\nThey
    stand before all the eliminated contestants, who will soon be voting for who
    should be crowned the winner of this competiton.\n\nBut first, the finalists
    have a chance to make their cases for why they should win.\n\nWhen asked, \"why
    do you deserve to win this competition?\" what does $p say?\n\n "
  WaitingForNpcFinalistSpeech: 'Waiting for the last finalist to make their case...


'
  FinalistSpeech: '$n:

    $s


'
  EliminatedNpcAnnounceWinnerVote: '$n has voted and has the following to say to
    each finalist:


    $f


    $a


    $n has voted for $w!'
  EliminatedAddressesFinalist: '$n turns to $w.

    $f'
  WinnerAnnouncement: 'And with $#/$t votes, we have a winner! It''s $w! Congratulations!!


    Thanks
    for playing, and congratulations to $w!'
